  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: eab4cdc8e4d686148b79bf5f8bcfd170, type: 3}
  title: Cooking Carnage README
  sections:
  - heading: Welcome to Cooking Carnage, your favorite Steam project !
    text: This readme and others like it should provide you with enough information
      to get started.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Readmes
    text: You will perhaps encounter other Readme's like this one. They are meant
      to help you to understand how to use assets, hierarchy, and other stuff. If
      you do not understand or if you do not agree with Readme's, don't hesitate
      to share it with the group !
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: How to make your own readme ?
    text: You are more than welcome to contribute to the documentation of this project
      ! Simply right-click in the project view, and go to Create > Readme. Further
      instructions can be found there. Happy writing !!
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: To do lists
    text: To do lists are scattered across the project, with a cute icon of Fabrice.
      You can read them and do what they say if you don't know what to do. You can
      make your own to do lists by righ-clicking in the project view, and Create>Markdown.
      You can open them and write your to do list with the markdown syntax (same
      as Discord's). Make sure to add "To Do" in the name of the file to get the
      nice icon :) (spaces and case are ignored)
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Drive
    text: 
    linkText: Link towards the project's google drive
    url: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JQWZA5G6AdX_C1WWDDwQ4TWhAosyRzZ2
